 font-style=\"italic\">directed + undirected edges</text><defs><marker id=\"g-arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,1 L0,5 L6,3 z\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\"></path></marker></defs></svg></div><div><h3>Graphs</h3><p><span>avg <!-- -->O(V + E)</span><span>space <!-- -->O(V + E)</span></p></div></div><div><h3>Heaps / Priority Queues</h3><p><span>avg <!-- -->O(log n)</span><span>space <!-- -->O(n)</span></p></div><div><h3>Tries</h3><p><span>avg <!-- -->O(m)</span><span>space <!-- -->O(n * m)</span></p></div></div><div><div><h3>Sorting</h3><p><span>avg <!-- -->O(n log n)</span><span>space <!-- -->O(log n)</span></p></div><div><div><svg width=\"220\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><rect x=\"26\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#06b6d415\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><text x=\"39\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"400\">1</text><text x=\"39\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">0</text></g><g><rect x=\"54\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.12)\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"></rect><text x=\"67\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.85)\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"400\">3</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">1</text></g><g><rect x=\"82\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f59e0b25\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></rect><text x=\"95\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">2</text></g><g><rect x=\"110\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.12)\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"></rect><text x=\"123\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.85)\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"400\">7</text><text x=\"123\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">3</text></g><g><rect x=\"138\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.12)\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"></rect><text x=\"151\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.85)\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"400\">9</text><text x=\"151\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">4</text></g><g><rect x=\"166\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#06b6d415\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect><text x=\"179\" y=\"51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\" font-weight=\"400\">11</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">5</text></g><text x=\"39\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">L</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">R</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">mid</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(100,116,139,0.5)\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"Inter, sans-serif\" font-style=\"italic\">O(log n) search</text></svg></div><div><h3>Binary Search</h3><p><span>avg <!-- -->O(log n)</span><span>space <!-- -->O(1)</span></p></div></div><div><div><svg width=\"220\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 110\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.25)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><g><rect x=\"86\" y=\"4\" width=\"28\" height=\"22.400000000000002\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8b5cf622\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><text x=\"100\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">f(n)</text></g><g><rect x=\"46\" y=\"34\" width=\"28\" height=\"22.400000000000002\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#06b6d415\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><text x=\"60\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">f(n-1)</text></g><g><rect x=\"126\" y=\"34\" width=\"28\" height=\"22.400000000000002\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#06b6d415\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><text x=\"140\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#06b6d4\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, monospace\">f(n-1)</text></g><g><rect x=\"22\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"22.400000000000002\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.12)\" stroke=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><text x=\"36\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,0.7)\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"JetBrains Mono, mo